Explanation:
Functions used: isna().sum(), dropna(), fillna(), mean(), median()
Usage: isna().sum() to count missing values, dropna() to drop and fillna() to fill missing values, mean and median to calculate the mean and median values.
Interpretation: Median is safer because it resists distortion from extreme outliers.
